{"seq":3,"slug":"form-and-momentum","title":"形与势","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/form-and-momentum","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"substance-and-void","title":"虚实之道：避实击虚与致人而不致于人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/form-and-momentum/substance-and-void","wordCount":1692,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"orthodox-and-unorthodox","title":"奇正之变与形势","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/form-and-momentum/orthodox-and-unorthodox","wordCount":1756,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"形与势\">形与势</h1><p>本章阐述孙子关于用兵之法的辩证范畴。&quot;虚实&quot;之道，主张避实击虚、致人而不致于人；&quot;奇正&quot;与&quot;形势&quot;，则揭示了以正合以奇胜、造势任势的用兵智慧。两篇文档，分别阐述虚实之道，以及奇正之变与形势。</p>\n"}